  "selection": "LP2 physical pages 23–51, all earlier LP1 combined-archive JPEG objects, historical Gematria chart, original public key/early 2012 images and a broad selection of public 2012–2014 author-era messages; no later solver material. Dates are upper bounds by puzzle year/release rather than inferred HTTP capture times. Chart is decoded only from preserved base64; signature attaches to extracted message, not entire chart. Recipient-specific 2012 messages and private one-time ciphertexts are excluded; period-original generic instructions are included as archival text only.",
